Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
22.4 The late universe: an accurate analytic solution, the age, and the \
radion today\
\>", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"1326ef5f-a783-f849-ab22-1792e9a7dc78"],

Cell["\<\
Below about 1 MeV the brane contains photons and three neutrino species (\
\[CapitalOmega]_r from T_CMB = 2.7255 K and N_eff = 3.044), matter (\
\[CapitalOmega]_m = 0.315, of which the cold dark matter would be \
dirac16complex if it is the dark matter) and \[CapitalLambda]4 (\
\[CapitalOmega]_\[CapitalLambda] = 1 \[Minus] \[CapitalOmega]_m \[Minus] \
\[CapitalOmega]_r), with H0 = 67.4 km/s/Mpc (Planck 2018). The Friedmann \
equation Ha = H0 (\[CapitalOmega]_r a\:207b\:2074 + \[CapitalOmega]_m a\:207b\
\.b3 + \[CapitalOmega]_\[CapitalLambda])^(1/2) has two exact solutions for \
two components:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"4c692c4e-055e-fe4b-9097-43cfa5650681"],

Cell["\<\
      t_rm(a) = (2/(3H0 \[CapitalOmega]_m\.b2)) [(\[CapitalOmega]_m a \
\[Minus] 2\[CapitalOmega]_r) (\[CapitalOmega]_r + \[CapitalOmega]_m a)^(1/2) \
+ 2\[CapitalOmega]_r^(3/2)]   (radiation + matter),\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"bb843905-6978-aa41-923b-bdaebfe6636f"],

Cell["\<\
      t_m\[CapitalLambda](a) = (2/(3H0 \
\[CapitalOmega]_\[CapitalLambda]^(1/2))) arcsinh((\[CapitalOmega]_\
\[CapitalLambda]/\[CapitalOmega]_m)^(1/2) a^(3/2))   (matter + \
\[CapitalLambda]),\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"621aafb0-e909-0440-b41a-28dc480134d3"],

Cell["\<\
and the composite t(a) = t_rm(a) + t_m\[CapitalLambda](a) \[Minus] t_m(a), \
t_m = (2/(3H0 \[CapitalOmega]_m^(1/2))) a^(3/2), is accurate to 2.2 \[Times] \
10\:207b\:2074 at every time (the error is the product of the small radiation \
and \[CapitalLambda] corrections). The age is 13.79 Gyr. During this regime \
the radion sits at \[Beta]_eq = [\[CapitalLambda]4 + \[Kappa] f_W/V\[UpTee] + \
(\[Kappa]/2)(\[Epsilon] \[Minus] 3pa) + \[Kappa] pb \[Minus] 12\[Alpha]_2 Ha\
\.b2(Ha\[Prime] + Ha\.b2)]/(3 m_r\.b2) (section 20.3) \[LongDash] of order H0\
\.b2/m_r\.b2 \[TildeTilde] 10\:207b\:2078\:2076 without brane tension, f_W/(3 \
M_Pl\.b2 m_r\.b2) \[TildeTilde] 6 \[Times] 10\:207b\.b2\:2074 with f_W = M8\
\:2074 (m_r = 10 GeV) \[LongDash] so G4 = G8/V\[UpTee] does not change; the \
Gauss\[Dash]Bonnet and cubic corrections are \[Alpha]_2 H0\.b2 \[TildeTilde] \
2 \[Times] 10\:207b\:2079\.b2 and \[Alpha]_3 H0\:2074 \[TildeTilde] 4 \
\[Times] 10\:207b\.b9\:2079\:2070 (\[Alpha]_2 = 1/M8\.b2, \[Alpha]_3 = 10\
\:207b\:2076/M8\:2074).\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"7c3fa1b2-850a-fc4d-ba8d-a6f49683b79a"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
rIImpc = 3.0856775814913673 10^19; rIIgyr = 3.15576 10^16; rIIH0s = \
67.4/rIImpc; rIIH0g = rIIH0s rIIhbar;
rIIrhoc = 3 rIIH0g^2 rIIMPl^2; rIITcmb = 2.7255 8.617333262 10^-14;
rIIOg = (Pi^2/15) rIITcmb^4/rIIrhoc; rIIOr = rIIOg (1 + 7/8 (4/11)^(4/3) \
3.044); rIIOm = 0.315; rIIOL = 1 - rIIOm - rIIOr;
rIIH[a_] := rIIH0s Sqrt[rIIOr/a^4 + rIIOm/a^3 + rIIOL];
rIIage = NIntegrate[1/(a rIIH[a]), {a, 0, 1}, PrecisionGoal -> 12, \
MaxRecursion -> 30]/rIIgyr;
check[\"age of the universe from the brane Friedmann equation: 13.79 Gyr \
(Planck 2018: 13.787 +- 0.020)\", Abs[rIIage - 13.79] < 0.02]
rIIt[a_] := NIntegrate[1/(xa rIIH[xa]), {xa, 0, a}, PrecisionGoal -> 12, \
MaxRecursion -> 30];
rIItrm[a_] := 2/(3 rIIH0s rIIOm^2) ((rIIOm a - 2 rIIOr) Sqrt[rIIOr + rIIOm a] \
+ 2 rIIOr^(3/2));
rIItmL[a_] := 2/(3 rIIH0s Sqrt[rIIOL]) ArcSinh[Sqrt[rIIOL/rIIOm] a^(3/2)]; \
rIItm[a_] := 2/(3 rIIH0s Sqrt[rIIOm]) a^(3/2);
rIIcomp = Table[Abs[(rIItrm[a] + rIItmL[a] - rIItm[a])/rIIt[a] - 1], {a, \
10^Range[-8, 0.5, 0.25]}];
check[\"composite analytic solution t(a) = t_rm(a) + t_mLambda(a) - t_m(a) \
accurate to < 3 10^-4 for 10^-8 <= a <= 10^0.5\", Max[rIIcomp] < 3 10^-4]
{\"Omega_r, Omega_Lambda, z_eq, age (Gyr)\" -> {rIIOr, rIIOL, rIIOm/rIIOr - \
1, rIIage}, \"max error of the composite solution\" -> Max[rIIcomp],
 \"radion displacement today (m_r = 10 GeV): Lambda4 + matter, tension f_W = \
M8^4\" -> {(3 rIIH0g^2 rIIOL + 1.5 rIIH0g^2 rIIOm)/(3 100.), \
(rIIM8^4/rIIMPl^2)/(3 100.)},
 \"alpha2 H0^2, alpha3 H0^4\" -> {rIIH0g^2/rIIM8^2, 10^-6 rIIH0g^4/rIIM8^4}}\
\>", "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[1072]:=",ExpressionUUID->"0b1c9601-d647-0746-8198-e717c2332fc1"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"\<\"age of the universe from the brane Friedmann equation: 13.79 \
Gyr (Planck 2018: 13.787 +- 0.020)\"\>", "\[Rule]", "True"}]], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{4.002143487570366*^9},
 CellLabel->
  "Out[1077]=",ExpressionUUID->"bd212981-f938-ea4d-b521-81be71c59e1b"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"\<\"composite analytic solution t(a) = t_rm(a) + t_mLambda(a) - \
t_m(a) accurate to < 3 10^-4 for 10^-8 <= a <= 10^0.5\"\>", "\[Rule]", 
  "True"}]], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{4.00214348762109*^9},
 CellLabel->
  "Out[1082]=",ExpressionUUID->"251238d3-6f96-fe41-b823-717ae2163f52"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"\<\"Omega_r, Omega_Lambda, z_eq, age (Gyr)\"\>", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
     "0.00009209579083825092`", ",", "0.6849079042091618`", ",", 
      "3419.3517569357623`", ",", "13.790686840671638`"}], "}"}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"max error of the composite solution\"\>", "\[Rule]", 
    "0.00022015727631385928`"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"radion displacement today (m_r = 10 GeV): Lambda4 + matter, \
tension f_W = M8^4\"\>", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"1.7412962725620153`*^-86", ",", "5.6218701994499004`*^-24"}], 
     "}"}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"alpha2 H0^2, alpha3 H0^4\"\>", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"2.0670464555964897`*^-92", ",", "4.27268104959401`*^-190"}], 
     "}"}]}]}], "}"}]], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{4.002143487623087*^9},
 CellLabel->
  "Out[1083]=",ExpressionUUID->"77c8ff09-f682-9049-b3e1-1f2ca8fe9137"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["23. Regime III: the far future", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"f5d8de03-3e4f-1d42-83d1-3e4daea3e084"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["23.1 The de Sitter attractor", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"1993ccb1-dd88-574b-a510-a8eca641cc73"],

Cell["\<\
Once matter has diluted, \[CapitalLambda]4 dominates and ordinary space \
approaches de Sitter expansion with H\[Infinity] = H0 \[CapitalOmega]_\
\[CapitalLambda]^(1/2) (1.81 \[Times] 10\:207b\.b9\:2078 s\:207b\.b9, Gibbons\
\[Dash]Hawking temperature H\[Infinity]/(2\[Pi]) \[TildeTilde] 2.2 \[Times] \
10\:207b\.b3\:2070 K). For matter + \[CapitalLambda] the solution is exact,\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"0347fa45-a523-9c48-8942-20fb3594297a"],

Cell["\<\
      a(t) = (\[CapitalOmega]_m/\[CapitalOmega]_\[CapitalLambda])^(1/3) \
sinh^(2/3)(3H\[Infinity]t/2),   Ha(t) = H\[Infinity] coth(3H\[Infinity]t/2) \
\[RightArrow] H\[Infinity] + 2H\[Infinity] e^(\[Minus]3H\[Infinity]t),\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"d3af4886-640c-4e45-a12a-754bc24328d6"],

Cell["\<\
and it agrees with the full solution (radiation included) to 10\:207b\:2074 \
already at a = 3. Pairs of dirac16complex are created with the \
Fermi\[Dash]Dirac occupation 1/(e^(2\[Pi]M/H\[Infinity]) + 1) of section \
14.5; 2\[Pi]M/H\[Infinity] \[TildeTilde] 5 \[Times] 10\.b3\.b3 for M = 1 eV, \
so none are.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"c7c40b29-ad56-5a47-88f0-713ab5d33c7f"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
rIIIH = rIIH0s Sqrt[rIIOL];
check[\"far future: Ha(t) = H_inf Coth[3 H_inf t/2] agrees with the full \
brane solution at a = 3 and a = 10 to 10^-4\",
  AllTrue[{3, 10}, Abs[rIIIH Coth[3/2 rIIIH rIIt[#]]/rIIH[#] - 1] < 10^-4 &]]
{\"H_inf (1/s, GeV), T_GH (K)\" -> {rIIIH, rIIIH rIIhbar, rIIIH rIIhbar/(2 \
Pi)/(8.617333262 10^-14)}, \"2 Pi M/H_inf for M = 1 eV, 1 GeV\" -> {2 Pi \
10^-9/(rIIIH rIIhbar), 2 Pi/(rIIIH rIIhbar)}}\
\>", "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[1084]:=",ExpressionUUID->"d817f9b6-b73f-704d-b443-f053c13fab5b"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"\<\"far future: Ha(t) = H_inf Coth[3 H_inf t/2] agrees with the \
full brane solution at a = 3 and a = 10 to 10^-4\"\>", "\[Rule]", 
  "True"}]], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{4.0021434876350784`*^9},
 CellLabel->
  "Out[1085]=",ExpressionUUID->"52987d3e-aaf9-3d4e-a931-989d0cb84342"],

Cell[BoxData[
