    {"\<\"generalized Kronecker delta with 9 upper indices vanishes in 8 \
dimensions (100 random index sets)\"\>", "True"},
    {"\<\"xAct declaration as in the reference notebook: \
SignatureOfMetric[g71] == {7, 1, 0} (seven space-like dimensions, one \
