     "True"},
    {"\<\"eta17 is simply the squares of the octonion basis: eta17[[A+1, \
B+1]] == Re(e_A e_B), e_0^2 == +1 (time x0), e_i^2 == -1 (space x_i, i = \
1..7)\"\>", "True"},
    {"\<\"the quadratic form of the octonions has the signs of the squares of \
the octonion basis: Re(x x) == x0^2 - x1^2 - ... - x7^2 == x.eta17.x for x = \
x^A e_A (symbolic)\"\>", "True"},
    {"\<\"xAct: Lovelock1 == R_a^b - (1/2) delta_a^b R, the Einstein tensor \
