\"\>", "True"},
    {"\<\"Kasner pair creation: |alpha|^2 + |beta|^2 == 1 (to 10^-8) for \
(|p|, |q|) = (1,1), (2,1), (1,3)\"\>", "True"},
    {"\<\"Kasner scaling: (|p|, |q|) = (1.4302.., 2.5) has K = 1 and the same \
|beta|^2 as (1, 1) (to 10^-6)\"\>", "True"},
    {"\<\"16x16 evolution == 4 copies of the 2x2 evolution with +m sigma3 and \
4 with -m sigma3 (Kasner, m = 0.3, |p| = 1, |q| = 1.5, x0 from 0.05 to 40): \
