    {"\<\"flat limit: pa == pb == rho eps_F - eps (Gibbs-Duhem), which is 0 \
at the saturation density\"\>", "True"},
    {"\<\"energy-momentum conservation of the Kohn-Sham matter: eps' + \
3Ha(eps + pa) + 4Hb(eps + pb) == 0 (a = 1 + 0.3x + 0.05x^2, b = 1/(1 + 0.2x), \
